\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-details\fR
print all fields of the entries

.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-sdr\fR
read the SDRs to print the sensor names and the converted values of threshold events

.SH COMMAND \fI\,'pyipmi sel clear'\/\fR
