Clear SEL

.SH COMMAND \fI\,'pyipmi sel info'\/\fR
usage: pyipmi sel info [\-h]

Print the information about the SEL

.SH COMMAND \fI\,'pyipmi sel time'\/\fR
usage: pyipmi sel time [\-h] <command> ...

Get or set the SEL time (UTC)

.SH
POSITIONAL ARGUMENTS \fI\,'pyipmi sel time'\/\fR
.TP
\fBpyipmi sel time\fR \fI\,get\/\fR
Print the SEL time
.TP
\fBpyipmi sel time\fR \fI\,set\/\fR
Set the SEL time

.SH COMMAND \fI\,'pyipmi sel time get'\/\fR
usage: pyipmi sel time get [\-h]

Print the SEL time

.SH COMMAND \fI\,'pyipmi sel time set'\/\fR
usage: pyipmi sel time set [\-h] {"YYYY\-MM\-DD HH:MM:SS",now}

Set the SEL time

.TP
\fB{"YYYY\-MM\-DD HH:MM:SS",now}\fR
the time in UTC, or now for the time of this host

