usage: pyipmi sensor set\-reading [\-h] [\-l LUN] number reading

Set the reading of a sensor (Set Sensor Reading and Event Status)

.TP
\fBnumber\fR
sensor number

.TP
\fBreading\fR
raw reading

.SH OPTIONS \fI\,'pyipmi sensor set\-reading'\/\fR
.TP
\fB\-l\fR \fI\,LUN\/\fR, \fB\-\-lun\fR \fI\,LUN\/\fR
