.SH OPTIONS \fI\,'pyipmi sensor read'\/\fR
.TP
\fB\-t\fR \fI\,<type>\/\fR, \fB\-\-type\fR \fI\,<type>\/\fR
sensor type, a name like temperature, voltage, current, fan or power\-supply, or a number

